# =============================================================================
# p2k .gitignore
# NOTE: OS, IDE, and general Python rules are in the root ../../.gitignore.
#       This file contains only project-specific rules.
# =============================================================================

# --- Python bytecode (belt-and-suspenders, root also covers this) ---
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Virtual environment ---
.venv/

# --- Environment variables & secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem

# --- Configuration files with secrets ---
config.json
config_test.json
secrets.json

# --- Pipeline output ---
# The canonical example batches below are committed intentionally (see the
# root .gitignore's "Bundled dataset" note) so a fresh clone has real,
# populated graphs to inspect. Everything else under pipeline-output/ is a
# regeneratable local run — ad-hoc test runs, dated batches, benchmark-corpus
# outputs — and should not be committed. Ignore every pipeline-output
# subdirectory by default, then opt only the canonical batches back in.
# If a new domain's example batch should become canonical, add it here too.
pipeline-output/*/
!pipeline-output/_merged/
!pipeline-output/comercial_lending/
!pipeline-output/fannie_mae/
!pipeline-output/freddie_mac/
!pipeline-output/healthcare/

# --- Pipeline data (SQLite run history DB) ---
pipeline-data/

# --- Compliance source documents ---
# Markdown/CSV compliance files ARE tracked.
# Ignore PDFs if they appear (large binaries).
#*.pdf

# --- Data directories (legacy structure) ---
data/input/knowledge-files/*.pdf
data/intermediate/knowledge-files-organized/*
!data/intermediate/knowledge-files-organized/.gitkeep
data/intermediate/entity-relationship/*.json
data/intermediate/entity-relationship/*.csv
data/output/knowledge-graph-files/*
!data/output/knowledge-graph-files/.gitkeep

# --- Logs ---
*.log
logs/

# --- Testing ---
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
ui/frontend/playwright-report/
ui/frontend/test-results/

# --- Docker ---
.dockerignore.bak
docker-compose.override.yml

# --- Backup / temp files ---
*.backup
*.bak
*.tmp
*.old

# --- Report temporary files ---
reports/*.txt.tmp
reports/*.html.tmp
